Description: rplaza provides an R interface to the PLAZA database
    for plant comparative genomics data. rplaza allows loading
    of PLAZA data (e.g., sequences, annotation, functional annotation,
    homologous gene families) to an R session using core Bioconductor
    data structures, streamlining interoperability and data analyses.
